    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head>Geþyn. 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif man gehádedum oððe ælþeodigum ahwar gederede wórdes oððe weorces, þonne gebyrede biscpe 7 cynge, þæt hi þæt betan, swa hi raðost mihton.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone, anywhere, injured an ecclesiastic or a stranger by word or deed, then it was the concern of the bishop and the king, that they should atone for it as quickly as they could.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gif hit gewurde þæt man gehadedum oððe ælþeodigum ahwar gederode wordes oððe weorces, þonne gebyrede cinge 7 bisceope, þæt hig þæt betan, swa hig raþost mihton.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And if it so happened anywhere that someone injured one in orders or a stranger by word or deed, then it was the responsibility of the king and the bishop to remedy it as swiftly as they could.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
